window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I've lived in the mud quarter my entire life, watching as the fireguards came every five years to select the prettiest girls to go to the Seat to start new lives.</b></p> <p>They get it all: husbands, houses without a speck of dirt, and enough food that hunger wasn't a constant pain in your belly.</p> <p>This year, it's my turn.</p> <p>The dragon that forces our kingdom to cower under our magnificent dome and hide behind stone walls hasn't shown any signs of leaving.</p> <p>A mud girl has no business succeeding in the queen's game, but when I do, she tries to execute me by throwing me into the dragon's path. But you know what was more shocking? When the dragon transforms into a man and kisses me.</p> <p>Kingdom of Flames &amp; Flowers <i>is a why-choose, dragon-shifter fantasy romance intended for mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
